{"title": "Sunwalker's Gift (passive feature)", "pageid": 28575, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sunwalker's_Gift_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Sunwalker's Gift</b> is a passive feature that grants darkvision.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer can see in the dark up to 12 m (40 ft). \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunwalker%27s_Gift\" title=\"Sunwalker's Gift\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sunwalker%27s_Gift\" title=\"Sunwalker's Gift\">Sunwalker's Gift</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Sunwalker's Gift does not provide the cone of light that is otherwise granted by the Darkvision effect from a different source, such as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision_(spell)\" title=\"Darkvision (spell)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/30px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision_(spell)\" title=\"Darkvision (spell)\">Darkvision</a> spell, the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Darkvision\" title=\"Elixir of Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Darkvision\" title=\"Elixir of Darkvision\">Elixir of Darkvision</a>, or the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/30px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a> racial passive.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202837\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1697/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14336/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5061/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 966142/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.415      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   42.415      1 -total\n 38.73%   16.428      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 34.09%   14.461      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 32.06%   13.598      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 26.03%   11.040      2 Template:Item_icon\n 12.71%    5.390      2 Template:SmSAI\n 12.07%    5.121      1 T